<figure class="chapter-visual fermi-explorer" data-fermi-explorer>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：Fermi–Dirac 占据随能量的变化</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: Fermi–Dirac occupation versus energy</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls chapter-visual__controls--two">
    <label>
      <span>化学势 μ | Chemical potential (eV)</span>
      <input type="range" min="-1" max="1" step="0.05" value="0" data-fermi-mu />
      <output data-fermi-mu-output>0.00 eV</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>热能 kBT | Thermal energy (eV)</span>
      <input type="range" min="0.02" max="0.50" step="0.01" value="0.20" data-fermi-tau />
      <output data-fermi-tau-output>0.20 eV</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg class="fermi-explorer__plot" viewBox="0 0 600 270" role="img" aria-labelledby="fermi-title fermi-desc">
    <title id="fermi-title">Fermi–Dirac occupation curve</title>
    <desc id="fermi-desc">Occupation probability from zero to one over an energy interval from minus two to two electronvolts.</desc>
    <line x1="50" y1="225" x2="550" y2="225" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="50" y1="25" x2="50" y2="225" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="300" y1="25" x2="300" y2="225" class="plot-guide" data-fermi-mu-line />
    <line x1="50" y1="125" x2="550" y2="125" class="plot-guide" />
    <path d="M 50 25 C 210 25 258 45 300 125 C 342 205 390 225 550 225" class="plot-curve" data-fermi-curve />
    <text x="550" y="250" text-anchor="end">E (eV)</text>
    <text x="22" y="35">f(E)</text>
    <text x="42" y="230" text-anchor="end">0</text>
    <text x="42" y="130" text-anchor="end">0.5</text>
    <text x="42" y="30" text-anchor="end">1</text>
    <text x="50" y="250" text-anchor="middle">−2</text>
    <text x="300" y="250" text-anchor="middle">0</text>
    <text x="550" y="250" text-anchor="middle">2</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>在 E = μ 处 | At E = μ:</span>
    <strong data-fermi-half>f(μ) = 0.500000</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>单粒子能级与热库达到平衡，使用 <code>f(E) = 1 / (exp[(E − μ)/(kBT)] + 1)</code>；横轴和参数均以 eV 表示。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> single-particle levels in thermal equilibrium with a reservoir, using <code>f(E) = 1 / (exp[(E − μ)/(kBT)] + 1)</code>; energies are in eV.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>任意允许的 μ 和正的 kBT 下都应满足 <code>f(μ) = 1/2</code>；减小 kBT 应使曲线在 μ 附近更陡。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> every allowed μ and positive kBT must give <code>f(μ) = 1/2</code>; reducing kBT must sharpen the curve near μ.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>模型只给出既定单粒子能级的统计占据，不计算能级本身，不包含电子相互作用、散射或材料输运。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the model assigns occupations to prescribed levels; it does not compute those levels or include interactions, scattering, or material transport.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-fermi-explorer]').forEach((root) => {
    const muInput = root.querySelector('[data-fermi-mu]');
    const tauInput = root.querySelector('[data-fermi-tau]');
    const muOutput = root.querySelector('[data-fermi-mu-output]');
    const tauOutput = root.querySelector('[data-fermi-tau-output]');
    const halfOutput = root.querySelector('[data-fermi-half]');
    const curve = root.querySelector('[data-fermi-curve]');
    const muLine = root.querySelector('[data-fermi-mu-line]');
    if (!(muInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(tauInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;
    if (!(curve instanceof SVGPathElement) || !(muLine instanceof SVGLineElement)) return;

    const energyToX = (energy) => 50 + 500 * (energy + 2) / 4;
    const occupationToY = (occupation) => 25 + 200 * (1 - occupation);

    const update = () => {
      const mu = Number(muInput.value);
      const tau = Number(tauInput.value);
      const points = [];
      for (let index = 0; index <= 160; index += 1) {
        const energy = -2 + 4 * index / 160;
        const occupation = 1 / (Math.exp((energy - mu) / tau) + 1);
        points.push(`${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${energyToX(energy).toFixed(2)} ${occupationToY(occupation).toFixed(2)}`);
      }
      curve.setAttribute('d', points.join(' '));
      const muX = energyToX(mu).toFixed(2);
      muLine.setAttribute('x1', muX);
      muLine.setAttribute('x2', muX);
      if (muOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) muOutput.value = `${mu.toFixed(2)} eV`;
      if (tauOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) tauOutput.value = `${tau.toFixed(2)} eV`;
      if (halfOutput instanceof HTMLElement) halfOutput.textContent = 'f(μ) = 0.500000';
    };

    muInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    tauInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>
